# Linear surface trap for 40Ca+ with a loading zone, two storage zones, five gate zones and a measurement zone, 100 µm
# apart, with integrated photonics for every zone: photoionization (423 nm and 375 nm) and cooling light at the loading
# zone, qubit and quench light at every gate zone, and detection and repump light above a detector at the measurement
# zone. Generated by Trap.from_layout("load, storage x2, gate x5, measure", zone_spacing=100.0). Its zones span 800 µm,
# so making wells in all of them needs a build with more spheres: make clean && make DEFINES="-DNSPH_X=31".
# Lengths are in µm, the RF frequency in rad/s, optical powers in W and dark count rates in 1/s.

trap n_electrodes 39
trap n_electrodes_rf 2
trap n_electrodes_dc 37
trap V_RF 40
trap Omega_RF 251327412.2871832

